description: CSS sizes and colors for the client
globs: client/**/*.css
alwaysApply: true
---

# CSS

- Sizes are `rem`. Border widths stay `px`, because borders are borders.
- Colors come from the theme palette on `:root` in
  `client/src/global.css` (`var(--color-…)`). A new color is a new token
  there, not a raw value in a component.
